function selectTimelineTarget(kind,id,extra={}){timelineSelection={kind,id,...extra};if(kind==='speed'){if(!extra.prop)openSpeed(id);}else if(kind==='object')select(id);else if(kind==='field')editPoint('field',id);else if(kind==='explosion')editPoint('explosion',id);else{const e=timelineTarget(kind,id);if(e)e.target.startsWith('g')?selectGroup(e.target):select(e.target);tab('force');}renderTimelineRows();}
function removeTimelineItem(el){const {kind,id,prop,keytime}=el.dataset;mutate(()=>{const target=timelineTarget(kind,id);if(prop==='key')target.keys=target.keys.filter(k=>k.time!==+keytime);else if(prop==='releaseTime')delete target.releaseTime;else if(kind==='event')project.events=project.events.filter(x=>x.id!==id);else if(kind==='explosion')project.explosions=project.explosions.filter(x=>x.id!==id);else if(kind==='field')project.fields=project.fields.filter(x=>x.id!==id);else if(kind==='speed')project.speedSegments=project.speedSegments.filter(x=>x.id!==id);},kind==='speed');}
function keyframeSource(){const f=selectedField();if(f)return {kind:'field',target:f};const o=!pointEdit&&!forceEdit?selected():null;return o&&!o.virtual?{kind:'object',target:o}:null;}
function curveTarget(kind=keyframeSource()?.kind,id=keyframeSource()?.target.id,keytime=timelineSelection?.kind===kind&&timelineSelection?.id===id&&timelineSelection?.prop==='key'?timelineSelection.keytime:null){if(!['field','object'].includes(kind))return null;const target=timelineTarget(kind,id);if(!target||target.virtual)return null;const keys=(target.keys||[]).filter(k=>k.time>0).sort((a,b)=>a.time-b.time),key=keytime!=null?keys.find(k=>k.time===keytime):keys.find(k=>k.time>time)||keys.at(-1);if(!key)return null;const start=Math.max(0,...(target.keys||[]).filter(k=>k.time<key.time).map(k=>k.time));return {kind,id,time:key.time,start,label:kind==='field'?FIELD_NAMES[target.kind]+' '+id.slice(1):target.name||id,key};}
